WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.960
Hi mystery recapped here . Today I'm going&nbsp;
to explain the Korean romantic comedy movie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:16.160
“The Beauty Inside”. Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead. Watch out and take care.
 
&nbsp;

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:21.760
The movie revolves around a guy named Woo-jin,&nbsp;
who suffers from a rare condition. On his 18th&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:26.640
birthday, he first learned about his condition&nbsp;
which makes him wake up with a different face and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:33.040
body every morning. He was shocked and puzzled by&nbsp;
his condition at first. He told his mother Mun Suk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:38.880
about his disease. She had a hard time adjusting&nbsp;
to it but eventually accepted him for who he is.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:45.120
Woo-jin also came clean to his childhood best&nbsp;
friend Sang-baek, who also accepted him. With&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:50.880
Mun Suk and Sang-baek’s support, Woo-jin starts&nbsp;
to embrace his truth and learn to live with his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:56.080
strange condition. Every morning, Woo-jin&nbsp;
wakes up in a different body of varying age,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:02.720
gender and nationality. Some days he’s a&nbsp;
man, a woman, old, young or even a foreigner.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:07.760
Because of his condition, he can speak a different&nbsp;
language depending on who he wakes up that day as.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:11.600
Although he is always someone new&nbsp;
on the outside, he’s the same person&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:16.400
on the inside. He is now used to seeing a&nbsp;
different face in the mirror every morning.
&nbsp;

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:21.200
Woo-jin records himself every morning on&nbsp;
his computer to keep a record. Everyday is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:25.760
challenge for him as he has to accustom himself&nbsp;
to the changes of being a different person.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:33.040
He must adjust to his body, eyesight, voice etc.&nbsp;
He has a collection of all sorts of clothes, shoes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:39.040
to fit any and every type of body type. He also&nbsp;
has all types of toiletries for males and females.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:44.400
He owns a phoropter to test his vision each day&nbsp;
and a foot measuring device to measure his feet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:48.800
which helps him select the right shoe.
Woo-jin and Sang-baek have a furniture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:55.280
company called ALX, which makes unique high-end&nbsp;
custom-made furniture for each individual client.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.280 --> 00:02:00.720
The former works as a furniture designer while&nbsp;
Sang-baek handles the manufacturing and sales.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.840
This allows Woo-jin to work&nbsp;
in the privacy of his own home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:08.800
and avoid others from finding out about him.
One day, Woo-jin meets a beautiful girl named&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:14.640
Yi-soo who works at a furniture store. He&nbsp;
falls for her beauty, mind and kind nature.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:19.520
He starts visiting the store every day to see&nbsp;
her. Unbeknownst to her, he talks to her in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:24.720
a different avatar each time. But despite his&nbsp;
changing appearance, Yi-soo would always treat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:30.560
him the same. Woo-jin waits until he wakes up as a&nbsp;
handsome guy to finally ask the girl out on a day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:36.080
He takes her to the ALX factory on the first&nbsp;
date as she had expressed deep admiration for ALX&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:41.680
products in Woo-jin’s many encounters with her.&nbsp;
They eat sushi and have a great time together.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:46.240
He asks her on another date the next day. He&nbsp;
wants to meet her as the same handsome guy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:50.560
so he stays up all night so as to not&nbsp;
wake up as someone else the next morning.
&nbsp;

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:55.680
This goes on for several days and Woo-jin gets&nbsp;
more and more sleep deprived with each passing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.680 --> 00:03:02.080
day. The two start falling for each other and&nbsp;
become inseparable overtime. However, one day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:07.440
Woo-jin falls asleep on a metro and wakes up&nbsp;
as someone else. Afraid of freaking her out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:11.280
he cancels his date with her and&nbsp;
decides to never see her again.
&nbsp;

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:16.880
However, he gives in to his urges and continues&nbsp;
to text her. He sends her a custom made furniture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:21.040
designed just the way she likes&nbsp;
it. The furniture helps Yi-soo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:26.400
impress her boss. Woo-jin also applies as a&nbsp;
girl to work part time at Yi-soo’s work place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:31.200
just so he could be close to her. He befriends&nbsp;
her and asks to have dinner with her after work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:36.400
He takes her to the ALX factory and gathers the&nbsp;
courage to come clean about his identity and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:40.960
condition to her. He shows her the videos he&nbsp;
recorded on his laptop to her, where he talks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:45.440
about her. He tells her about the conversions&nbsp;
they had over dinner about antique furniture,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:51.680
guitars and music. However, Yi-soo finds it hard&nbsp;
to believe and thinks it is some sick prank being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:57.840
played on her. She tells Woo-jin to never contact&nbsp;
her again and storms out of the warehouse. Woo-jin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:02.960
breaks into tears and drowns in despair.
Yi-soo soon starts missing Woo-jin and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:07.280
begins to wonder what if he was telling her&nbsp;
the truth. The table that he had gifted her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:12.640
reminds her of him everyday. One day, she&nbsp;
decides to go meet him and drops by his home.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:18.000
Woo-jin opens the door as a girl and the two have&nbsp;
dinner. Woo-jin explains his condition to her and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:23.120
Yi-soo decides to sleep with him so she could&nbsp;
see Woo-jin waking up as a different person. 
&nbsp;

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:28.560
Before sleeping, Woo-jin tells her more about his&nbsp;
condition and how he copes with it. He reveals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:33.200
that he is 29 years old. He had made peace&nbsp;
with his condition but ever since he met her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.400
it has gotten even more difficult to&nbsp;
live with the condition. He tried to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:41.920
stay away from her but he just couldn’t resist. 
Yi-soo wakes up the next day to find the same girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:46.880
she had dinner with the other day sleeping next&nbsp;
to her. She lets Woo-jin sleep and goes through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:52.560
his clothes, shoes and videos on his laptop.&nbsp;
When Woo-jin wakes up, he wakes up as a boy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:58.240
Yi-soo finally believes his claim and starts to&nbsp;
accept him for who he is on the inside. They again&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:03.680
start to meet everyday and Woo-jin is elated to&nbsp;
meet the same girl he likes for more than a week.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:08.880
They go to different places and talk about silly&nbsp;
things. She gets used to Woo-jin one day waking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:14.320
up as a middle aged man and some other day as a&nbsp;
child. Meanwhile, Woo-jin feels safe around her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:19.600
and has not known loneliness in a long time.&nbsp;
To find each other in the crowd, Woo-jin holds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:24.320
Yi-soo’s hand to let her know that it’s him.
With Woo-jin spending most of his time with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:29.200
Yi-soo, he starts slacking on the work front.&nbsp;
Sang-baek starts complaining to him about his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:36.640
lack of attention to his designs. Woo-jin assures&nbsp;
him that he will refocus his energy on work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:40.640
With Woo-jin struggling at work,&nbsp;
Yi-soo pitches a new idea to him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:46.640
She advises him to start the second ADX line with&nbsp;
standardized sizes at moderate prices. This would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:52.720
give more people access to the ALX world and open&nbsp;
new doors for the company. Woo-jin loves the idea,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:57.360
which surprises Sang-baek because Woo-jin&nbsp;
always shoots down any new ideas he pitches. 
&nbsp;

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:02.800
One day, Yi-soo’s furniture studio throws&nbsp;
a party and Woo-jin gets an invitation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:08.080
Yi-soo’s boss is excited to meet Yi-soo’s ALX&nbsp;
boyfriend. She is also interested in meeting him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:13.520
because everyone describes a different person when&nbsp;
talking about Yi-soo’s boyfriend. Unfortunately,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:17.920
on the day of the party, Woo-jin wakes&nbsp;
up as an old woman. He goes back to sleep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:22.960
and fortunately wakes up as a decent looking man.
Woo-jin finally arrives at the party and holds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:27.840
Yi-soo’s hand to let her know that it is him.&nbsp;
Yi-soo finally gets her coworkers off her back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:31.920
about wanting to meet her boyfriend and&nbsp;
the pair have a great time at the party.
&nbsp;

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:37.520
The next day, Woo-jin takes Yi-soo to meet&nbsp;
his mother Mun Suk at her shop. Mun Suk is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:41.440
happy that her son has finally found someone&nbsp;
he could spend the rest of his life with.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:45.360
She gives them her best wishes and hopes&nbsp;
that they won’t end up hurting each other.
&nbsp;

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:50.080
It is not always sunshine and rainbows&nbsp;
for the couple. One time, Woo-jin upsets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:54.640
Yi-soo when he randomly holds her hand&nbsp;
in a crowd with a new and unknown face,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.640 --> 00:07:00.320
freaking her out. Seeing her hurt, he apologises&nbsp;
to her and promises to never do it again.
&nbsp;

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:04.160
Seeing the two head over heels for each&nbsp;
other, Sang-baek asks his friend why he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:09.200
hasn't proposed marriage to Yi-soo yet. Woo-jin&nbsp;
too had been thinking about proposing to her but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:12.560
had always been on the fence about&nbsp;
it. With Sang-baek’s encouragement,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:18.320
he decides to propose his Yi-soo. He works&nbsp;
really hard to custom design a ring for her.
&nbsp;

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:22.880
Meanwhile, people begin to gossip about Yi-soo&nbsp;
after seeing her out with a different man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:28.240
everyday. This starts to take a toll on her mental&nbsp;
health and she increasingly becomes forgetful.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:32.480
She begins to take pills to cope with&nbsp;
her stress, anxiety and insomnia.
&nbsp;

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:37.280
Amidst all this, Woo-jin broaches the topic&nbsp;
of marriage to Yi-soo and as expected,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:41.520
she isn’t so keen on marriage right now.&nbsp;
She tells him that there are many things to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:45.600
consider before getting married. She says that&nbsp;
everytime he looks in the mirror each morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:50.320
he needs time to accept himself, to test&nbsp;
his vision, and to measure his feet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:55.760
Similarly, she needs time to think about marrying&nbsp;
all those different people. She also can’t imagine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.760 --> 00:08:01.200
how she’s going to introduce him to her parents.&nbsp;
Yi-soo’s response really upsets Woo-jin. He had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:05.360
thought that they were on the same page but it&nbsp;
seems they are reading two different books.
&nbsp;

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:10.560
The conversion overwhelms Yi-soo and she takes&nbsp;
a high dosage of her pills. She falls ill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:15.200
and is rushed to the hospital. Woo-jin learns&nbsp;
that she had been taking Risperidone pills for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:20.320
her stress and sleeplessness. He also finds&nbsp;
an audio message of Yi-soo’s psychiatrist&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:25.920
advising her to not see Woo-jin for some time&nbsp;
for her mental health. Woo-jin is taken aback&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:30.640
by all these revelations. He wonders if it was&nbsp;
her fault for not telling him or if he was too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:35.440
blind to notice that Yi-soo had been silently&nbsp;
suffering. He eventually concludes that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:40.560
was the one, who was blinded by fantasy.
Woo-jin can’t seem to find a way out of this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:44.960
and goes to meet his mother. Mun suk tells him&nbsp;
that she had expected this would happen one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:49.520
day or another. She tells him that Yi-soo&nbsp;
will be fine as long as Woo-jin and her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:55.120
aren’t together. Puzzled, Woo-jin asks her what&nbsp;
she’s talking about. She then reveals that Woo-jin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.120 --> 00:09:00.720
inherited this condition from his father. Mun&nbsp;
Suk loved Woo-jin’s father dearly at first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:06.000
but people began gossiping. They accused her&nbsp;
of being promiscuous. She tried to ignore it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:11.040
but one day, Woo-jin’s father disappeared.&nbsp;
He left her a letter, apologising to her for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:16.720
making her life hell. Woo-jin is moved to tears&nbsp;
by the revelation and he starts wondering if too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:21.760
has to leave Yi-soo for her betterment. 
After Yi-soo is discharged from the hospital,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:27.520
Woo-jin meets her for the last time and breaks up&nbsp;
with her. He tells her that it is the right choice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:31.840
and asks her to stop taking those pills&nbsp;
before disappearing from her life.
&nbsp;

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:36.320
The break up devastates Yi-soo and&nbsp;
she thinks about Woo-jin everyday.
&nbsp;

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:42.800
Ten month pass by. Yi-soo can now sleep without&nbsp;
pills but she still dearly misses Woo-jin. One&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:47.760
day, Yi-soo’s boss shows her furniture designs&nbsp;
from a Czech website and asks her to find the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:53.200
designer's contact details. Yi-soo notices&nbsp;
Woo-jin’s trademark style in those designs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:57.360
and suspects that he is the designer.
She then goes to meet Sang-baek in his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:02.960
office. However, Sang-baek acts cold towards&nbsp;
her and refuses to talk to her about the designs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:08.560
and Woo-jin. Before leaving, Yi-soo notices&nbsp;
a cargo box shipped from the Czech Republic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:13.520
in Sang-baek’s office, further confirming her&nbsp;
suspicions that Woo-jin is in the Czech Republic.
&nbsp;

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:19.520
Realising that being away from Woo-jin hurts her&nbsp;
more than people’s gossip, Yi-soo flies to Czech&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:25.360
Republic. An unknown Korean man answers the door&nbsp;
at the website’s address. He denies knowing anyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:30.480
by the name of Kim Woo-jin but Yi-soo asks to&nbsp;
see the man’s furniture collection for her store.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:35.760
Inside, she notices shoes of different sizes&nbsp;
and gender further confirming that the man is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:40.640
Woo-jin. She expresses her love for him and tells&nbsp;
him that she wants to spend the rest of her life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:45.920
with him. Coming clean as Woo-jin, he tells her&nbsp;
that he doesn’t want to make her sick again.
&nbsp;

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:51.120
Yi-soo tells him she knows that being with him is&nbsp;
going to be challenging but being without him is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:56.000
much worse. The two break into tears. 
After collecting themselves, they then go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.000 --> 00:11:01.200
out for a walk in the Czech Republic’s picturesque&nbsp;
capital. Yi-soo tells him that she doesn’t care&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:07.040
if he changes everyday and she loves the Kin&nbsp;
Woo-jin inside him. The movie ends with Woo-jin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:11.920
taking out the ring he had made earlier in the&nbsp;
film and finally putting it on her finger.
 
&nbsp;

